      "level": 2,
      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lvjq6sc",
      "content": "• Union Budget is presented by the Finance Minister."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "664eiut",
      "content": "• Financial year in India is April to March."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8oltgew",
      "content": "• GST was implemented in India in 2017."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1v7za45",
